# text = And whenever it is so addressed , it is never , on this occasion or on any other , dividedly addressed ; it is always concentrated Mr . Jasper opens a door at the upper end of the room , and discloses a small inner room pleasantly lighted and prepared , wherein a comely dame is in the act of setting dishes on table cries the young fellow , with a clap of his hands Mr . Jasper answers , pausing to consider Fixed as the look the young fellow meets , is , there is yet in it some strange power of suddenly including the sketch over the chimneypiece
