# text = So he is gloomily borne off to the Lumps-of-Delight shop , where Rosa makes her purchase , and , after offering some to him ( which he rather indignantly declines ), begins to partake of it with great zest : previously taking off and rolling up a pair of little pink gloves , like rose-leaves , and occasionally putting her little pink fingers to her rosy lips , to cleanse them from the Dust of Delight that comes off the Lumps Rosa being short is Rosa's quiet commentary contradiction rising in him is the quiet commentary again is the quick reply , ( Rosa's being a little one says Rosa , with a satisfied nod , and tranquilly enjoying the Lumps with some warmth Determined not to assent says Edwin , becoming heated After a pause , in which the whimsically wicked face has not been unobservant of him , Rosa says says Rosa , shrugging her shoulders , with a little laugh of wonder Edwin inquires , with a majestic turn of his eyes downward upon the fairy figure he returns with angry emphasis Very firmly often nodding her head , and much enjoying the Lumps
# sent_id = 135
