# text = Perhaps one of the highest uses of their ever having been there , was , that there might be left behind , that blessed air of tranquillity which pervaded Minor Canon Corner , and that serenely romantic state of the mind -- productive for the most part of pity and forbearance -- which is engendered by a sorrowful story that is all told , or a pathetic play that is played out .
