# text = Let whomsoever it most concerned look well to it The two young men , having seen the damsels , their charges , enter the courtyard of the Nuns' House , and finding themselves coldly stared at by the brazen door-plate , as if the battered old beau with the glass in his eye were insolent , look at one another , look along the perspective of the moonlit street , and slowly walk away together says Neville is the careless answer is the condescending answer repeats Edwin Drood , with a touch of contempt Neville has made his remark in a watchfully advancing , and yet furtive and shy manner , very expressive of that peculiar air already noticed , of being at once hunter and hunted .
