# text = For , it would seem that he , too , has strolled round by the Nuns' House , and has come up behind them on the shadowy side of the road he says laying his left hand on the inner shoulder of that young gentleman , and thus walking on between them , hand to shoulder on either side After a silent struggle between the two young men who shall speak last , Edwin Drood strikes in with says Neville Landless , though not so freely ; or perhaps so carelessly says Jasper , in a soothing manner Still , not quite so frankly or so freely ; or , be it said once again , not quite so carelessly perhaps Neville feels it impossible to say less , but would rather not go .
