# text = When he opens the door , candle in hand , his cheerful face falls , and disappointed amazement is in it The Minor Canon props him by the elbow with a strong hand ( in a strictly scientific manner , worthy of his morning trainings ), and turns him into his own little book-room , and shuts the door says the Minor Canon , shaking his head with a sorrowful smile is the dry rejoinder rejoins the Minor Canon , mildly , but firmly pursues the young man , instantly obeying with an irrepressible outburst is Mr . Crisparkle's quiet commentary Scooping his hand into the same scientific elbow-rest as before , and backing it up with the inert strength of his arm , as skilfully as a Police Expert , and with an apparent repose quite unattainable by novices , Mr . Crisparkle conducts his pupil to the pleasant and orderly old room prepared for him .
