# text = Grewgious , referring to his notes , disposing of asked Rosa , looking up quickly said Rosa , hurriedly and earnestly said Mr . Grewgious Rosa looked at him with some wonder he explained said Rosa , taking the paper with a prettily knitted brow , but not opening it Rosa , with her perplexed face and knitted brow , bit the corner of her attested copy , as she sat with her head on one side , looking abstractedly on the floor , and smoothing it with her foot said Mr . Grewgious Mr . Grewgious said all this , as if he were reading it aloud ; or , still more , as if he were repeating a lesson .
