# text = So expressionless of any approach to spontaneity were his face and manner he added , blurring out Rosa shook her head , with an almost plaintive air of hesitation in want of help said Rosa , plaiting the crease in her dress returned Mr . Grewgious Blurring pencil once again said Rosa , rising , as he jerked out of his chair in his ungainly way he rejoined ; apparently -- if such a word can be used of one who had no apparent lights or shadows about him -- complimented by the question For his ready acquiescence , the grateful Rosa put her hands upon his shoulders , stood on tiptoe , and instantly kissed him cried Mr . Grewgious rejoined Miss Twinkleton , rising with a gracious condescension said Mr . Grewgious , stammering a little cried Miss Twinkleton , with a chastely-rallying forefinger Miss Twinkleton might have said a pen-and-ink-ubus of writing out Monsieur La Fontaine Miss Twinkleton here achieved a curtsey , suggestive of marvels happening to her respected legs , and which she came out of nobly , three yards behind her starting-point .
