# text = So he descended the stair again , and , crossing the Close , paused at the great western folding-door of the Cathedral , which stood open on the fine and bright , though short-lived , afternoon , for the airing of the place said Mr . Grewgious , peeping in Old Time heaved a mouldy sigh from tomb and arch and vault ; and gloomy shadows began to deepen in corners ; and damps began to rise from green patches of stone ; and jewels , cast upon the pavement of the nave from stained glass by the declining sun , began to perish .
