# text = Long afterwards he had cause to remember how Jasper sprang from the couch in a delirious state between sleeping and waking , and crying out The glare of his eyes settled down into a look of recognition , and he moved a chair or two , to make a way to the fireside returned Mr . Crisparkle , as he sat himself down in the easy-chair placed for him A very perplexed expression took hold of Mr . Jasper's face ; a very perplexing expression too , for Mr . Crisparkle could make nothing of it was Jasper's inquiry , in a low and slow voice , after a silence Jasper turned that perplexed face towards the fire .
