# text = The visitor came in accordingly said Mr . Grewgious , looking round his pair of office candles returned Edwin said Mr . Bazzard at the door said Mr . Grewgious Edwin took the easy-chair in the corner ; and the fog he had brought in with him , and the fog he took off with his greatcoat and neck - shawl , was speedily licked up by the eager fire said Edwin , smiling cried Mr . Grewgious said Edwin , glancing about him as though attracted by the notion of a new and relishing sort of gipsy-party said Mr . Grewgious said Mr . Grewgious , dropping his voice , and speaking with a twinkling eye , as if inspired with a bright thought Bazzard reappeared was the gloomy answer cried Mr . Grewgious said Bazzard said Mr . Grewgious
