# text = After a little rolling about , in a close scuffle which caused the faces of both to be besmeared with blood , the man took his knee from Neville's chest , and rose , saying It was immediately done said the man , as he spat out some blood , and wiped more from his face When his face was cleansed , Neville recognised in the speaker , Joe , driver of the Cloisterham omnibus , whom he had seen but once , and that on the day of his arrival Utterly bewildered , Neville stared around him and said not a word .
