# text = But for the hands , he might have thought he had never seen the face Mr . Grewgious saw a lead-coloured face in the easy-chair , and on its surface dreadful starting drops or bubbles , as if of steel Mr . Grewgious saw a ghastly figure rise , open-mouthed , from the easy-chair , and lift its outspread hands towards its head Mr . Grewgious saw the ghastly figure throw back its head , clutch its hair with its hands , and turn with a writhing action from him Mr . Grewgious heard a terrible shriek , and saw no ghastly figure , sitting or standing ; saw nothing but a heap of torn and miry clothes upon the floor .
