# text = Yet the sunlight shone in at the ugly garret-window , which had a penthouse to itself thrust out among the tiles ; and on the cracked and smoke-blackened parapet beyond , some of the deluded sparrows of the place rheumatically hopped , like little feathered cripples who had left their crutches in their nests ; and there was a play of living leaves at hand that changed the air , and made an imperfect sort of music in it that would have been melody in the country .
