# text = Her jingling conveyance stopped at last at a fast-closed gateway , which appeared to belong to somebody who had gone to bed very early , and was much afraid of housebreakers ; Rosa , discharging her conveyance , timidly knocked at this gateway , and was let in , very little bag and all , by a watchman said the watchman , pointing further in .
