# text = While she was thinking about it Mr . Grewgious suddenly jerked out of himself for the second time cried Rosa , drawing her chair a little nearer , and her mind reverting to Jasper said Mr . Grewgious , in a solemn whisper Rosa seemed much relieved pursued Mr . Grewgious in the same tone Rosa looked reflective , and nodded her head slowly ; as who should say said Mr . Grewgious said Rosa , innocently , with her eyebrows again in action said Mr . Grewgious , passing his hand under his chin Rosa appeared to consider what she would do if the awkward supposititious case were hers said Mr . Grewgious Mr . Grewgious shook his head seriously , as if he felt the offence to be a little too much , though of his own committing asked Rosa said Mr . Grewgious said Mr . Grewgious said Rosa Rosa looked at him as if she would have liked him to be the recipient of a thousand dedications said Mr . Grewgious asked Rosa answered Mr . Grewgious
