# text = It was not hard to divine that Mr . Grewgious had related the Bazzard history thus fully , at least quite as much for the recreation of his ward's mind from the subject that had driven her there , as for the gratification of his own tendency to be social and communicative he said at this point Rosa , composed now , gave him a faithful account of the interview .
