# text = They complied ; Mr . Tartar none the less readily , for being all abroad ; and Mr . Grewgious , seated in the centre , with his hands upon his knees , thus stated his idea , with his usual manner of having got the statement by heart said Mr . Crisparkle , who had been very attentive added Mr . Tartar , smiling said Mr . Grewgious said Mr . Crisparkle said Mr . Tartar cried Mr . Grewgious , smoothing his head triumphantly said Rosa , blushing a little as Mr . Tartar looked quickly towards her said Mr . Grewgious asked Mr . Grewgious , as she hesitated said Rosa , shyly returned that gentleman Rosa , not quite knowing what to say about that , cast down her eyes , and turning to Mr . Grewgious , dutifully asked if she should put her hat on ?
