# text = It did seem likely inquired Helena Rosa looked back again in a flutter , instead of supplying the name answered Helena , with indignation With a mournful shake of the head , as if that would be quite a superfluous entreaty , Helena lovingly kissed her two hands to her friend , and her friend's two hands were kissed to her ; and then she saw a third hand ( a brown one ) appear among the flowers and leaves , and help her friend out of sight .
