# text = It will be seen that the Billickin now openly pitted herself against Miss Twinkleton , as one whom she had fully ascertained to be her natural enemy returned Miss Twinkleton , from a remote moral eminence retorted the Billickin , throwing in an extra syllable for the sake of emphasis at once polite and powerful said Miss Twinkleton , still from her distant eminence resumed the Billickin , in a courtly manner , ' before retiring on the began Miss Twinkleton , when the Billickin neatly stopped her began Miss Twinkleton , when again the Billickin neatly stopped her stipulated the Billickin , expressly resumed Miss Twinkleton proclaimed the Billickin to Rosa , loftily cancelling Miss Twinkleton observed Miss Twinkleton said the Billickin , with a sarcastic smile observed Miss Twinkleton with majestic cheerfulness said the Billickin , at once affectionately and distantly The Billickin gracefully withdrew with this parting speech , and from that time Rosa occupied the restless position of shuttlecock between these two battledores .
