# text = During its continuance she has had no power of sight , or any other power not absorbed in the struggle ; but as it leaves her , she begins to strain her eyes , and as soon as she is able to articulate , she cries , staring cries the woman , with a propitiatory laugh replies the visitor He divests himself of his shoes , loosens his cravat , and lies across the foot of the squalid bed , with his head resting on his left hand says the woman approvingly Entering on her process , and beginning to bubble and blow at the faint spark enclosed in the hollow of her hands , she speaks from time to time , in a tone of snuffling satisfaction , without leaving off .
