# text = The friendly darkness , at that hour , renders it easy for her to ascertain whether this be so or not ; and it is so , for the passenger not to be missed twice arrives among the rest An observation addressed to the air , and yet it might be addressed to the passenger , so compliantly does he go on along the High Street until he comes to an arched gateway , at which he unexpectedly vanishes .
